export function isBackgroundSize(value: string,segment: (source: string,separator: string) => string[],isLength: (source: string) => boolean,isPercentage: (source: string) => boolean): boolean {
 let count=0;
 for(const size of segment(value,',')){
  if(size === 'cover' || size === 'contain'){count++;continue;}
  const values=segment(size,' ');
  if(values.length !== 1 && values.length !== 2){return false;}
  let allValid=true;
  for(const part of values){if(part === 'auto' || isLength(part) || isPercentage(part)){continue;}allValid=false;break;}
  if(allValid){count++;}
 }
 return count > 0;
}
